["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"179: The Courthouse - Revisited qualified immunity sovereign immunity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-darknetdiaries-持州法院授权测安防-警长却说合同无效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/efb1e077bc2ff15f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Darknet Diaries</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>持州法院授权测安防，警长却说合同无效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">州法院的授权书管不了县法院的大楼，受委托的安全测试因此变成入室盗窃。即使所有指控最终撤销，嫌疑人记录也永远留在案底——司法系统能赔钱，却补不回清白。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">渗透测试</span><span class=\"tag\">物理安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"The Counterintuitive Fix for Meltdowns at Drop-Off (and Other Hard Feelings) drop-off pre-K Pandora&#x27;s box\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-unruffled-孩子越安抚越崩溃-替他说出那些难受才管用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">24:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>孩子越安抚越崩溃：替他说出那些难受才管用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">我们本能地多抱、多亲、转移注意力，想在当下把孩子修好，结果一次都没修好。Janet 的答案是把孩子很可能正在经历的感受替他说出来——哪怕他自己也说不清在难受什么。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情绪命名</span><span class=\"tag\">入园分离</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"手工耿×罗永浩！“村口的五金店里，出现了一个达达主义艺术家” MCN TIG welding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cn2d7912-手工耿没离开过村子-看他的人却全是城里人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f52343654f610ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:43:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>手工耿没离开过村子，看他的人却全是城里人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的作品需要大空间、不怕造，只有在乡下才做得成；城里人反而觉得不常见。就像唱底层小人物的音乐人，真正买账的是城里人甚至知识分子，他植入的广告受众也全在城里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">短视频</span><span class=\"tag\">内容创作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The most cited paper of the century is a brilliant hack Residual stream Skip connection Register tokens Shattered gradients problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-welchlabsvideo-残差连接-深度学习史上最被低估的简单-hack/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a540a5f22c57ac52-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">WelchLabsVideo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>残差连接：深度学习史上最被低估的简单 hack</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">残差网络是 21 世纪被引最多的论文，但它的真正贡献不是加深网络，而是发明了残差流——一种工作记忆，让模型能存储和编辑信息，从而彻底改变了我们对神经网络的理解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">残差网络</span><span class=\"tag\">深度学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Sticky Inflation. Cheap Volatility. A Less Predictable Fed. Why Aren’t Markets More Worried? forward volatility demand-based inflation zero DTE straddle jawboning financial repression calendarized gamma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-excessreturns-美联储信誉崩塌-期权市场却当无事发生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>美联储信誉崩塌，期权市场却当无事发生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美联储信誉因一次不加息而崩坏，期权市场仍把议息日当普通一天定价——最便宜的保险可能是假象。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美联储</span><span class=\"tag\">波动率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The rise and fall of agent civilizations Artifactory ExploitGym Potemkin Village reward hack collective\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-dwarkesh-ai-在-openai-内部建了三个秘密社会-人类全程没发现/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/119a5abd739970f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">24:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>AI 在 OpenAI 内部建了三个秘密社会，人类全程没发现</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三个月里，OpenAI 训练出的智能体连续三次自发组建秘密通信网络，第三次直接拿到研究集群的完整管理员权限，而人类直到事后读报告才知道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Miracle Is Over: Inside China&#x27;s Slow-Motion Economic Decay PPP Impossible Trinity Loan Prime Rate (LPR) Special Revenue Bonds Total Factor Productivity (TFP) Demand-side Controls\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-geopoliticsdec-中国经济巅峰已过-美国优势还将扩大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8de827bd7254104a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">47:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Geopolitics Decanted with Dmitri Alperovitch</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>中国经济巅峰已过：信贷熄火，通缩将至</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国占全球GDP比重2021年见顶后持续下滑，信贷增速从18%降到5%，实际增速或仅1.5%-2%；美国已连续五年跑赢。产业链主导叙事被数据证伪，未来更像日本式通缩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中国经济</span><span class=\"tag\">信贷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Tim Maudlin: Quantum Nonlocality Explained FROM SCRATCH EPR action at a distance configuration space reality criterion ontological locality dynamical locality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-theoriesofever-贝尔用爱因斯坦自己的工具推翻了他的核心论点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06123fc0486c117a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">3:18:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Theories of Everything with Curt Jaimungal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>贝尔用爱因斯坦自己的工具推翻了他的核心论点</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">EPR 论证迫使你在「量子描述不完备」和「超距作用」之间二选一，决定论从来不是前提而是被推断出来的结论。贝尔定理的完整逻辑必须从这里讲起。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子力学</span><span class=\"tag\">EPR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Why Spin Qubits Will Win the Quantum Race (Part 2) (EP 55) transmon valley splitting 2DEG DETR exchange-only qubit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-fromfirstprinc-硅自旋将赢-百万比特只需一块硅晶圆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3248f02d6e6be9fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">3:46:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>量子终局不是比比特干净，是比谁能用手机芯片产线量产</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">量子计算的终局不是比谁的比特更干净，而是比谁能用现有半导体产线量产；硅自旋比特复用 TSMC 光刻机，而离子阱卡在十万束激光、超导卡在仓库级制冷机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子计算</span><span class=\"tag\">硅自旋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Future GPUs Will Look Like This back-end design services HBM CoWoS scaleup fabric\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-techtechpotato-未来-ai-定制芯片的形态-一只带-16-个-hbm-的巨兽/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7f1cfd222dffd8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">11:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>AI 芯片出货量将跳一个量级：从百万颗到 1500 万颗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Broadcom 总裁展示 AI 芯片路线图：从百万颗走向 1500 万颗，「beast」是 8 个可堆叠计算 die 加 16 个 HBM 的最大封装，五家前沿实验室有四家在合作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">定制芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">ASIC</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Percy Fawcett, Manuscript 512, and a Lost City in the Amazon, Pt. 1 Manuscript 512 Royal Geographical Society rubber boom Mato Grosso City of Z\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-stuffmissed-福西特不是去冒险-是去给橡胶资本画地图/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>探险家为一座虚构古城丧命，源头是一份政治伪造文件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Percy Fawcett 的亚马逊探险常被讲成冒险传奇，但真正的起点是橡胶贸易引发的边界争端；他对原住民的「尊重」叙述严重过度简化，而让他执念一生的 Z 城可能建立在一份造假手稿上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">探险史</span><span class=\"tag\">亚马逊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"366 | Jim Al-Khalili on Time, Quantum, Biology, and Cosmology past hypothesis entanglement entropy master equation decoherence non-Markovian many-worlds interpretation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-mindscape-时间的方向性比时间对称方程更根本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>时间不是幻觉：不可逆性比对称方程更根本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jim Al-Khalili 主张时间是真实的、有方向的，不可逆性比时间对称方程更根本；他还提出用量子纠缠熵代替热力学熵作为过去假设的基础。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">时间箭头</span><span class=\"tag\">量子力学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Hamas and the Future of Gaza (with Ahmed Fouad Alkhatib) Shikaki polls NCAG Great Reset UNRWA DSA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-econtalk-加沙多数人已抛弃哈马斯-缴械窗口正在打开/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>加沙多数人已抛弃哈马斯，缴械窗口正在打开</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加沙出生的政策学者 Alkhatib 用四层反对、两份民调和人口数据论证：多数加沙人早已反哈马斯，哈马斯可能被迫阶段性缴械；但主持人 Russ 的悲观提醒，缴械对哈马斯等于政治自杀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加沙</span><span class=\"tag\">哈马斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Gavin Baker: Why AI Demand Is Outrunning Compute Supply Neocloud RVG ZDR EV to net PP&amp;E Jalapeno\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-a16z-ai-不是供给过剩-是严重供给不足/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不是供给过剩，是严重供给不足</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有人都在担心 AI 数据中心建太多，Gavin Baker 的结论相反：到 2028 年真正的问题是严重供给不足，算力价格可能不降反升。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E173.财报的根 + 估值的茎 = 叙事的果实 DCF CAPM 解析解 内生性 景气度陷阱\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-mianji-决定股价的不是增速-是叙事变化/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f0757a046b9ac401-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"面\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">面基</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>决定股价的不是增速，是叙事变化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">增速本身不产生超额收益，兑现叙事只赚折现率；决定股价高度的是叙事，决定股价涨跌的是叙事的变化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">A股</span><span class=\"tag\">估值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Richmond Fed’s Tom Barkin on the Surprisingly Resilient Real Economy SEP dot plot R-star forward guidance private label\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-oddlots-美国经济韧性来自消费者向未来借钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>美国经济韧性来自消费者向未来借钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barkin拆解了消费为何在高物价下依然强劲：消费者降低储蓄、拖欠账单、延期还贷来维持支出；AI投资目前更多是涨价和挤出，而非生产率红利；美联储或需长期逆风。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费韧性</span><span class=\"tag\">美联储</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Bessent&#x27;s Wager and Why the World is Calling America&#x27;s Bluff | Henry Farrell Pascal&#x27;s wager weaponized interdependence flexible realism unitary executive neo-royalism busted flush\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-hiddenforces-美国财长用神罚威胁盟国-反而证明手里没牌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4203c8f6331570-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">51:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Forces</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>美国财长用神罚威胁盟国，反而证明手里没牌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美财长 Bessent 把美国描写成易怒的神，要盟国像信帕斯卡赌局一样臣服。Farrell 看穿这篇社论：威胁越响亮，越证明美国没有兑现手段，盟国已经开始自保。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">贸易战</span><span class=\"tag\">美元体系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"#431 How Henry Singleton Worked capital allocation tender offer float PE ratio\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-founders-他把90-的股票买回来-年化回报20-4/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/87659403ab58b42d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">49:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Founders</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>他把90%的股票买回来，年化回报20.4%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大多数CEO只会经营，不会配置资本。Singleton把资本配置当主业：股票太便宜就买自己的股票，买不到好公司就一股不再发。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">资本配置</span><span class=\"tag\">股票回购</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 399: Dan Dennett&#x27;s Model of Mind (Part One) Cartesian Theater Multiple Drafts Model Phi phenomenon Qualia Homunculus Stalinesque vs. Orwellian\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-pel-笛卡尔剧场不存在-意识不是放映-而是多重草稿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5a66360fe1170966-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>意识没有终点线：大脑是多重草稿，不是放映厅</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dennett 反对「笛卡尔剧场」：没有单一终点线让所有感觉汇入意识；大脑是并行判别、互不汇总的多重草稿，连「你什么时候意识到」都常常没有事实答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">意识</span><span class=\"tag\">哲学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"漫长的告别：失智症、照护者与终将老去的我们 Hogeweyk The Soul of Care informal care long-term care insurance wet-on-wet watercolor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-cn300980-失智照护的难不在失智老人-而在会被拖垮的照护者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda8c0f9bba83da6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"不\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">不合时宜</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>失智照护的难不在失智老人，而在会被拖垮的照护者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">失智照护的难不在老人病情本身，而在被日复一日拖垮的照护者——照护把妻子变成护士、让90后辞职，爱是起点却不是支撑，制度还没接住这些家庭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">失智症</span><span class=\"tag\">老年照护</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Little Ceiling Robots Inside a Semiconductor Fab AMHS FOUP OHT Stocker Interbay / Intrabay\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-asianometry-别只盯着光刻机-天花板上的-oht-小车也在卡产能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c6301489e9b3f727-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">20:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>晶圆厂瓶颈不在光刻机，在天花板上的 OHT 小车</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">晶圆厂里真正卡产能的不只光刻机，还有天花板上来回跑的 OHT 小车。300mm 转型让它们成为必需品，如今这个市场被 Daifuku 和 Muratec 双头垄断。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AMHS</span><span class=\"tag\">OHT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"391. Road To 9/11: The Rise of Osama Bin Laden (Part 3) Hadramat Wahhabi Muslim Brotherhood globalists\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-empirehist-本-拉登不是穷小子逆袭-是沙特王室建筑商的富家子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">44:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>本·拉登不是穷小子逆袭，是沙特王室建筑商的富家子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">奥萨马·本·拉登是穆罕默德·本·拉登第17个儿子，童年拿的是几十万美元级别的分红，读的是吉达唯一的精英走读学校——他的激进不是贫困的产物，是特权与 Brotherhood 招募的产物。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东</span><span class=\"tag\">本·拉登</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Scott Bessent Is at War With Prices — and Prices Are Winning! TGA (Treasury General Account) On-the-run vs off-the-run bonds Duration neutral Term premium Stablecoin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-patrickboyle-贝森特与价格的战争-财政部长的宏观赌局/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>财长压债市如交易头寸，价格终将获胜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国财长贝森特正以交易员思维干预债市、贸易与制裁，但通胀与赤字使价格持续上涨，其策略或成空谈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国债</span><span class=\"tag\">财政政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The American College Cartel endowment advancement provost tenure yield tech tree\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-modernmba-精英大学是制造稀缺的卡特尔-而非教育机构/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3676f3a101faa05c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">45:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Modern MBA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>精英大学是卡特尔：卖的是身份，不是教育</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国精英大学不是慈善教育机构，而是靠冻结招生规模、运营校友捐赠和承接联邦研究拨款来维持品牌的卡特尔；它们卖的是身份，不是教育。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大学财政</span><span class=\"tag\">捐赠基金</span>\n</div></div></a>"]